sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User
    participant App as Translation App
    participant Azure as Azure<br/>Text Analytics
    participant UMLS as UMLS<br/>Terminology
    participant SNOMED as SNOMED CT<br/>Service
    participant Fallback as Fallback<br/>Translation List
    participant LLM as LLM<br/>(Ollama)

    User->>App: Translate medical text
    
    App->>Azure: Extract medical entities
    Azure-->>App: Medical concepts with codes
    
    loop For each concept
        App->>App: Check if concept has SNOMED code
        alt No SNOMED code
            App->>UMLS: Convert to SNOMED code
            UMLS-->>App: SNOMED code
        end
        App->>SNOMED: Get translated term
        alt No translation in SNOMED
            App->>Fallback: Retrieve human-verified translation
            Fallback-->>App: Localized medical term
        else Translation available
            SNOMED-->>App: Localized medical term
        end
    end
    
    App->>LLM: Translate with medical context
    LLM-->>App: Final translation
    
    App-->>User: Translated medical text
